WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.154
If your team has plenty of accounts but cannot tell which ones are becoming buyable now, this is the starting point.

00:00:07.154 --> 00:00:13.627
Account Timing Activation turns a broad market into a ranked set of accounts with a defensible reason to act.

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:21.121
We examine the changes around the account, the people involved, the likely commercial pressure, and the opening your team can use now.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:25.209
This is for revenue leaders who have coverage but lack timing clarity.

00:00:25.209 --> 00:00:28.956
Here is the important distinction: a list is not the result.

00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:34.407
The proof is a real commercial opening your team would not have found through ordinary targeting.

00:00:34.407 --> 00:00:43.264
The engagement succeeds when we produce a prioritized account path, identify the right stakeholder and reason to engage, and open or materially improve a qualified conversation.

00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:49.687
If account selection is slowing pipeline creation, book a qualified fifteen-minute conversation and bring one market or account set.
